  <Properties>
    <Name>!Jarcast &amp; Hokath's Additional Luxuries</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>Adds Alpaca, Camel, Feathers and Quartz luxury resources</Teaser>
    <Description>New Luxury Resources:
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Alpaca (pasture, hill)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Camel (pasture, desert)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Feathers (camp, forest/jungle)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Quartz (quarry, hill).</Description>
    <Authors>Jarcast, Hokath</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
